cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GEMs, please cite it as below."
title: "GEMs — GYNOID ENTITY MODELS"
abstract: >-
  Open-source designs of a physical humanoid body, meant to acquire physical
  experience on behalf of a controller that lives wholly off it: the Main
  Controller, on an IPC, for which each GEMs unit is a set of sensors and
  effectors. A
  platform specification: it declares capability envelopes and the trade-offs
  between them, and leaves the operating point to whoever runs the body. A
  paper design — nothing in it has been built or physically validated.
type: software
